515474374904"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/vkfrtci1ufbtbydsqersys6lx","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"vkfrtci1ufbtbydsqersys6lx","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/vkfrtci1ufbtbydsqersys6lx","published_at":"2026-11-05T17:51:52Z","ref":"A10","score":82,"selected":true,"source":"The Verge：AI（RSS）","summary":"美国中期选举民主党拿下参众两院，多场竞选以问责 AI 公司为主题，行业面临监管、数据中心建设放缓等前景。44 项地方数据中心暂停提案中 43 项通过，NBC 民调显示 76% 选民反对在社区建数据中心；专家称共和党禁止州级 AI 限制的尝试可能终结，OpenAI 和 Anthropic 未置评，据华尔街日报报道 CEO 们在私下讨论算力容量受限问题。","title":"美国中期选举蓝潮冲击 AI 行业，44 项数据中心暂停提案中 43 项通过","title_en":"‘Total repudiation’: The blue wave is about to hit AI","url":"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1026927/total-repudiation-the-blue-wave-is-about-to-hit-ai"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/wkgcal7l9pkj3g7w8ohlp3c45","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"wkgcal7l9pkj3g7w8ohlp3c45","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/wkgcal7l9pkj3g7w8ohlp3c45","published_at":"2026-11-05T17:05:47Z","ref":"A11","score":72,"selected":true,"source":"X：Perplexity (@perplexity_ai)","summary":"Perplexity 推出 Teammates 功能，这些智能体可承接任务，利用 Computer tasks、skills、memory 和工具主动工作。Teammates 之间可相互协作，还能在 Slack 中给同事发消息，目前已向 Max 订阅用户开放网页版。","title":"Perplexity 推出 Teammates 智能体，面向 Max 订阅用户开放","title_en":"Introducing teammates.","url":"https://x.com/perplexity_ai/status/2118389326459670825"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/yjwroxww17lcg4ntcu9ruo105","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"yjwroxww17lcg4ntcu9ruo105","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/yjwroxww17lcg4ntcu9ruo105","published_at":"2026-11-05T17:00:00Z","ref":"A12","score":74,"selected":true,"source":"Google Blog：AI（RSS）","summary":"Google 发布 Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash，在 Gemini API 和 Gemini for business 全面开放。新模型原生支持最长 15 秒视频生成（此前为 10 秒），支持多轮对话编辑和更强的参考图一致性，价格较 1.1 下降 30% 至 720p 视频 $0.07/秒。","title":"Google 发布 Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash：15 秒视频生成，降价 30% 至 $0.07/秒","title_en":"Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash: Fast and cost-effective with longer clips","url":"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/introducing-gemini-omni-1-2-flash/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/mpv0jfejdzdm2336jgtyj9tde","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"mpv0jfejdzdm2336jgtyj9tde","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/mpv0jfejdzdm2336jgtyj9tde","published_at":"2026-11-05T17:00:00Z","ref":"A13","score":66,"selected":true,"source":"Reflection Blog","summary":"Reflection 发布博文，讲解其开源权重模型 Beam 的安全训练与评估方法，并推出开源安全研究计划 Project Iris。Beam 在 Iris Safety Evaluations 对话任务中拒绝 89% 的有害请求，为所测开源权重模型中最高，同时遵守 82% 的安全相关无害请求；安全对齐教师模型从 100B 增至 501B 参数后，过度拒绝相对下降 48.7%。","title":"Reflection 详解开源模型 Beam 的安全训练与评估方法","title_en":"Open model safety: lessons from training and evaluating Beam","url":"https://reflection.ai/blog/open-model-safety-lessons"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/kl8ufrhv3zm38108gy2d7mins","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"opinion","id":"kl8ufrhv3zm38108gy2d7mins","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/kl8ufrhv3zm38108gy2d7mins","published_at":"2026-11-05T16:33:21Z","ref":"A14","score":70,"selected":true,"source":"X：Mustafa Suleyman（Microsoft AI CEO） (@mustafasuleyman)","summary":"Mustafa Suleyman 表示对特拉华州允许 AI 智能体经营企业的提案深感担忧，认为应非常谨慎。该提案拟设立名为 Delaware AIC 的独立法律实体，其日常事务由 AI 智能体而非人类管理，可依智能体指示以自身名义起诉应诉、持有和处置财产并承担债务。","title":"Mustafa Suleyman 对特拉华允许 AI 智能体经营企业的提案表示担忧","title_en":"Deeply concerning to me... Delaware proposal to let agents run businesees... we should be very cautious here","url":"https://x.com/mustafasuleyman/status/2118381163136123019"}],"counts":{"aihot_published":14,"aihot_upstream":14,"trendradar_matched":18,"trendradar_published":18,"trendradar_raw":255},"generated_at":"2026-11-07T00:31:36+08:00","report_date":"2026-11-07","run_id":"20261107T003136+0800","schema_version":1,"source_status":{"aihot":{"api_version":"2.0.0","page_count":1,"status":"live"},"trendradar":{"platform_count":11,"snapshot_count":1,"status":"live"}}